    "title": "Meet the candidates: Brazos County Commissioner, Precinct 4 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dylan Chryst Watkiss ,\n1 days ago BRAZOS COUNTY, Texas (KBTX) - Voters in Brazos County Precinct 4 will choose between Democratic incumbent Wanda J. Watson and Republican challenger Peter Michelena. Both describe Precinct 4 — largely north and west Bryan — as one of the county’s most diverse precincts, and both say giving it a voice on Commissioners Court is central to their campaigns. Read full article",
